 improvements include configuring HTML attributes such as: 'aria-describedby', 'autocomplete' (hinting what data to auto-fill according to the user's browser settings), and others. Introduces a Computed Field feature, to configure a determined value for form field for typical usage, but if failing validation checks on that condition the value can determined by user response on a resubmit. The Override feature allows for both setting defaults, or conditional defaults for both fields and for form control HTML attributes. A notable extension, included here, is displaying different label and help text for address form fields to adjust between assuming a local country postal format vs. a more international format while adding a country field (but only when needed). ","topics":[],"score":278122,"global_rank":45519,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6716},{"name":"JamesDansie/DxfMaze","owner":"JamesDansie","html_url":"https://github.com/JamesDansie/DxfMaze","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Read a floor plan (dxf file), make it into a graph, then solve the graph, and give back directions","topics":[],"score":278121,"global_rank":34330,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6717},{"name":"yizhongw/KDDCUP2015","owner":"yizhongw","html_url":"https://github.com/yizhongw/KDDCUP2015","stars":3,"forks":3,"watchers":4,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":278120,"global_rank":34332,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6718},{"name":"ianyepan/bitcoin-price-alert","owner":"ianyepan","html_url":"https://github.com/ianyepan/bitcoin-price-alert","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"Automatically refreshes the current Bitcoin price and plays \"You Suffer\" by Napalm Death every time it detects a price drop; and plays a cheerful notification whenever the price goes up. (Inspired by HBO series: Silicon Valley)","topics":[],"score":278105,"glob